msgid ""
"I love shopping! Man, there are so many different things I wanna get..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Hold on a second. I just realized I'm a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Huh? Wait, seriously?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Well, not like you can conjure up money out of thin air. We'll call it a "
"day, then. Let's hang out again, though, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "(Guess I should bring some cash next time...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Thanks so much, Kiryu-san! I wanted this sooo bad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "I'm glad you like it."
msgstr "Sono contento che ti sia piaciuto."

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... I'm gonna take super good care of this. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Come see me at the club sometime, okay?"
msgstr ""

